            "answer": "<ul><li>Premium Herbal Complex, a blend of plant extracts</li><li>Natural flavors</li><li>No artificial sweeteners, for a naturally pleasant taste</li><li>No parabens, so no synthetic preservatives</li><li>No SLS, a harsh foaming agent</li></ul>"
